WEBVTT

00:16.680 --> 00:20.280
Your eyes that look far off
into the distance

00:20.280 --> 00:23.950
They're listening to the voice
within your heart

00:23.950 --> 00:28.120
Embracing a moon still blue

00:31.160 --> 00:34.830
Your strength to keep on running

00:34.830 --> 00:38.470
Will open another new door for you

00:38.470 --> 00:42.670
Illuminate the night that
dawns too soon

00:45.670 --> 00:53.050
Even alone, I want to keep on
believing in you

00:53.050 --> 01:00.290
It's in such a moment that
this world will begin to stir

01:00.290 --> 01:03.930
What should we be searching for?

01:03.930 --> 01:07.560
Send out your soul

01:07.560 --> 01:14.300
We'll meet here again someday
if that's the truth

01:14.700 --> 01:18.410
Upon what should we fix our gaze?

01:18.410 --> 01:25.210
The reality that I reached out
and grabbed with my hand

01:25.210 --> 01:28.880
Let it go, let's believe in it

01:39.130 --> 01:40.400
Merciful Goddess,

01:40.400 --> 01:43.190
why did you send those four
along an earthbound path?

01:43.700 --> 01:48.100
Going to India would be much quicker
by the paths in the Heavens.

01:48.500 --> 01:50.940
If all they needed was
to get to India, yes.

01:51.770 --> 01:55.140
Currently, they are extremely lacking
in both the ability and solidarity

01:55.140 --> 01:57.940
that will be necessary in order
to accomplish our true goal.

01:58.610 --> 02:00.320
If you think of it as a trial
to hone those aspects,

02:00.320 --> 02:02.750
a somewhat difficult journey
should be good for them.

02:03.420 --> 02:06.690
How great of you to have thought
things out so far ahead.

02:06.690 --> 02:08.020
Just kidding.

02:08.020 --> 02:11.190
It's because it's more fun
this way, of course.

02:22.370 --> 02:26.140
995, 996...

02:26.840 --> 02:33.320
997, 998, 999...

02:33.320 --> 02:34.680
One thousand!

02:34.680 --> 02:36.820
All right, I'm done!

02:36.820 --> 02:39.310
Come on, everyone! Who's next,
who's next?!

02:42.460 --> 02:45.150
Ready, first comes rock,
rock, paper, scissors!

02:45.890 --> 02:49.490
You've got to be kidding me!
I've lost ten times in a row!

02:50.330 --> 02:52.570
He still hasn't caught on.

02:52.570 --> 02:56.610
His habit of always throwing a
scissors first is quite damning.

02:56.610 --> 02:58.000
He is a monkey after all.

02:58.470 --> 03:01.140
Man, how far do we have to walk?!

03:01.510 --> 03:04.570
Well, this rocky terrain is
impassable for a car.

03:06.980 --> 03:10.280
You! Can't you transform into
something other than a car?!

03:10.650 --> 03:12.390
Something other than a car!

03:12.390 --> 03:14.260
If you're gonna transform, at least
turn into an airplane!

03:14.260 --> 03:15.590
Teacher! An animal's
abusing an animal!
If you're gonna transform, at least
turn into an airplane!

03:15.590 --> 03:18.030
Teacher! An animal's
abusing an animal!
Come on, Hakuryu!
How about it?! Hey!

03:18.030 --> 03:19.020
Come on, Hakuryu!
How about it?! Hey!

03:22.260 --> 03:24.300
The sun is going to set

03:24.300 --> 03:27.040
before we get over the
mountains at this rate.

03:27.040 --> 03:31.060
In that case, shall we ask them
for a night's lodgings?

03:42.450 --> 03:44.920
That's some temple, man!

03:44.920 --> 03:46.320
Pardon me!

03:47.320 --> 03:48.990
What do you want?!

03:48.990 --> 03:54.430
We are travelers. Would you kindly
let us stay the night?

03:54.960 --> 03:57.370
This is a sacred temple, and therefore,

03:57.370 --> 03:59.890
we cannot allow strangers
within its walls!

04:00.300 --> 04:02.670
What the hell's up with that?!

04:02.670 --> 04:06.680
Man, that's why I hate monks!

04:06.680 --> 04:08.440
That's news to me.

04:08.440 --> 04:10.150
Oh, dear.

04:10.150 --> 04:12.270
Come on, I'm hungry!

04:12.750 --> 04:14.080
Sanzo!

04:14.080 --> 04:15.450
Sanzo?!

04:16.080 --> 04:17.550
Come to think of it,

04:17.550 --> 04:21.460
his attire is the same as that of the
late Priest Koumyou Sanzo.

04:21.460 --> 04:23.220
The Founding Scripture
of Heaven and Earth

04:23.220 --> 04:24.890
lies draped about his shoulders.

04:24.890 --> 04:27.100
And the crimson chakra upon his brow

04:27.100 --> 04:29.860
is the mark of one close to the gods.

04:31.100 --> 04:33.370
Might you be Priest Genjo Sanzo?!

04:33.370 --> 04:34.670
What?!

04:34.670 --> 04:36.570
Please pardon us!

04:36.570 --> 04:38.410
We will let you in right away!

04:46.310 --> 04:52.690
Priest Sanzo, you honor this old
temple with your presence.

04:52.690 --> 04:54.350
I am grateful for your welcome.

04:54.890 --> 04:58.460
Hey, is he really that much
of a big shot?

04:58.460 --> 05:01.620
Not so much that, but it is the
power of the title of Sanzo.

05:02.100 --> 05:04.170
There are five scriptures
in this world called

05:04.170 --> 05:07.340
the Founding of Heaven and Earth,
and it seems the title of Sanzo

05:07.340 --> 05:11.200
is given to the guardians of each
of these scriptures.

05:11.640 --> 05:16.100
Among Buddhists, they are revered
as the highest-ranking monks.

05:16.510 --> 05:20.720
How'd that godless bastard get to be
one of the highest-ranking monks?

05:20.720 --> 05:22.680
That is beyond my scope.

05:22.680 --> 05:25.320
Actually, Priest Koumyou Sanzo

05:25.320 --> 05:29.850
also graced this temple with his
presence a dozen or so years ago.

05:30.630 --> 05:34.360
The orderly and majestic appearance
of Master Koumyou

05:34.360 --> 05:36.490
is still fresh in my memory.

05:36.930 --> 05:42.870
If I may say so, Master Genjo, you
greatly resemble Master Koumyou.

05:44.910 --> 05:48.040
I had heard that when Master
Koumyou Sanzo passed away,

05:48.040 --> 05:54.050
you, his favorite pupil, had taken up
his mantle as Genjo Sanzo.

05:54.050 --> 05:55.820
Enough of such things.

05:55.820 --> 05:58.520
It is difficult to cross these rocky
mountains in one day,

05:58.520 --> 06:00.860
so we would like lodgings
for the night.

06:00.860 --> 06:04.020
Yes, of course, we would be
happy to, it's just that...

06:04.960 --> 06:06.190
Is there something?

06:06.190 --> 06:08.730
This is a sacred temple and by right,

06:08.730 --> 06:11.600
we do not allow outsiders to
pass through our doors.

06:11.600 --> 06:15.470
Those three gentlemen over there
hardly seem to be devout Buddhists.

06:16.570 --> 06:19.870
You'll let a monk stay, but John
Q. Public's not welcome?!

06:19.870 --> 06:21.910
What is this, an exclusive restaurant?!

06:21.910 --> 06:23.450
Now, now.

06:23.450 --> 06:25.450
That is fine with me.

06:25.450 --> 06:27.140
I knew he was gonna say that.

06:27.550 --> 06:31.150
They seem to be extremely
devout people.

06:31.150 --> 06:33.380
Don't you mean suspicious?

06:33.790 --> 06:35.920
Are they your pupils?

06:35.920 --> 06:38.730
No, they're my servants.

06:38.730 --> 06:39.430
Who's your servant?! Hey!
You're dead meat!

06:39.430 --> 06:41.730
Now, what does it matter?
There, there, whoa, whoa.
Who's your servant?! Hey!
You're dead meat!

06:41.730 --> 06:42.020
Now, what does it matter?
There, there, whoa, whoa.

06:48.040 --> 06:50.160
Hey! You bastard, that's
my xiaolongbao!

06:50.770 --> 06:52.440
Who cares? It's just a little bit.

06:52.440 --> 06:53.640
I care!

06:53.640 --> 06:54.800
Now, now.

07:00.180 --> 07:01.710
I finally feel alive again!

07:02.150 --> 07:04.190
This is a nice room.

07:04.190 --> 07:08.460
Well, I guess it's all thanks
to the great Master Sanzo.

07:08.460 --> 07:09.820
I'm going to kill you.

07:10.190 --> 07:12.890
Have you found the room
to your liking?

07:14.900 --> 07:19.430
I am Yo, and I have been given the
honor of seeing to your needs.

07:19.430 --> 07:21.740
I am pleased to make
your acquaintance.

07:21.740 --> 07:25.570
Man, they could've at least gotten
a pretty babe to serve us.

07:25.570 --> 07:27.580
Gojyo's very disappointed.

07:27.580 --> 07:31.840
What an impure thing to say! Women
are forbidden in this temple!

07:32.250 --> 07:34.080
Isn't that right, Master Sanzo?

07:34.980 --> 07:37.420
Why turn it over to me?

07:37.420 --> 07:41.820
I never thought I would ever meet
you in person, Master Sanzo!

07:41.820 --> 07:45.630
You are a holy man, chosen by
the Lord Buddha!

07:45.630 --> 07:49.290
You are an absolute presence to
those of us of the Buddhist faith!

07:50.030 --> 07:52.000
In all honesty, I am deeply moved!

07:52.000 --> 07:56.700
So I will put my heart and soul into
taking care of your needs!

07:57.270 --> 07:58.670
If there is anything you need,

07:58.670 --> 08:00.870
please do not hesitate to
call me. Goodnight.

08:05.880 --> 08:07.950
Holy man!

08:07.950 --> 08:11.250
I wish he could see Sanzo
with his gun blazing!

08:11.250 --> 08:13.150
This is truly...

08:13.150 --> 08:14.550
"Ignorance is bliss."

08:20.800 --> 08:23.730
Oh, man, I'm getting hungry already.

08:24.000 --> 08:27.870
It's because the food here is
all beans and vegetables.

08:28.370 --> 08:32.740
It can't be helped.
It's vegetarian cooking.

08:32.740 --> 08:35.680
We're all gonna start stinking
of incense pretty soon.

08:35.680 --> 08:38.240
Well, you'll just have to
deal with it for tonight.

08:43.420 --> 08:44.910
Last piece call.

08:45.490 --> 08:47.950
Call, all triple straights of 2-8.

08:48.460 --> 08:50.430
What do you think you're doing?!

08:50.430 --> 08:51.620
Mah-jongg!

08:52.060 --> 08:53.290
Damn it!

08:53.290 --> 08:54.800
So you were waiting for the
"five of wan" tile after all.

09:04.440 --> 09:06.410
We are confiscating all of this!

09:06.410 --> 09:07.040
Man...

09:07.040 --> 09:07.380
Man...
Do not "man" me! We are in
a sacred temple!

09:07.380 --> 09:11.150
Do not "man" me! We are in
a sacred temple!

09:11.150 --> 09:14.580
What kind of understanding do you
have of the way of the Buddha?!

09:14.580 --> 09:18.180
At this rate, you are sure to meet
Buddha's retribution someday!

09:18.790 --> 09:20.490
Buddha's retribution, is it?

09:20.490 --> 09:23.160
Hey, Sanzo, can you eat
Buddha's retribution?

09:23.160 --> 09:25.190
Yeah, but it probably won't taste good.

09:25.190 --> 09:27.790
Ooh! Are you even listening to me?!

09:28.930 --> 09:30.190
Nope...

09:34.740 --> 09:37.000
By the way, hasn't this temple
ever suffered

09:37.410 --> 09:39.570
at the hands of demons?

09:39.570 --> 09:41.800
No, of course not.

09:42.440 --> 09:44.810
It is said that by the Lord
Buddha's protection,

09:44.810 --> 09:47.110
this temple is warded from
such worldly things.

09:47.550 --> 09:51.520
Our deep devotion has been
communicated to the Lord Buddha.

09:51.520 --> 09:55.190
What are you gonna do if they
do attack, monk lackey?

09:55.190 --> 09:57.190
If such a thing should happen,

09:57.190 --> 10:00.160
the Merciful Goddess will
surely protect us.

10:00.160 --> 10:03.160
Then you don't have any
weapons here at all?

10:03.160 --> 10:07.600
Of course not, killing goes against
the way of the Buddha.

10:09.640 --> 10:11.470
In which case, there is
all the more reason

10:11.470 --> 10:14.170
for us to make our stay short.

10:21.280 --> 10:26.190
Beef, pork, chicken, fish.

10:26.990 --> 10:30.320
Women, liquor, smokes.

10:30.830 --> 10:33.330
You two are earthly desires incarnate.

10:33.330 --> 10:34.700
So, where's Sanzo?

10:34.700 --> 10:37.100
The Abbot called for him, so he left.

10:37.470 --> 10:38.860
This late?

10:42.200 --> 10:43.170
Hakuryu?

10:45.770 --> 10:46.900
This is...

10:56.450 --> 10:58.210
What's with this demonic aura?

10:59.050 --> 11:01.790
No way! Another assassin?!

11:01.790 --> 11:04.220
Unfortunately, it seems that way.

11:25.080 --> 11:28.110
You're here, aren't you, Genjo Sanzo?

11:29.720 --> 11:33.420
By Lord Kougaiji's orders,

11:33.420 --> 11:37.190
I've come to take your life!

11:46.170 --> 11:50.260
Well, well, there's a lot of
tasty-looking monks here.

11:51.810 --> 11:52.510
A demon?!

11:52.510 --> 11:52.810
It's a demon!
A demon?!

11:52.810 --> 11:53.670
It's a demon!

11:54.110 --> 11:55.200
Run!

11:56.910 --> 11:58.140
Help!

12:09.060 --> 12:10.160
Help!

12:10.160 --> 12:11.490
Do not panic!

12:12.430 --> 12:15.200
Use the signs! Form the signs
and chant the scriptures!

12:15.200 --> 12:18.470
By doing so, the holy power
of the Merciful Goddess

12:18.470 --> 12:21.570
will enable us to destroy
this vile demon!

12:21.570 --> 12:23.240
I see!

12:23.240 --> 12:24.260
Here we go!

12:32.750 --> 12:34.720
We did it! We're saved!

12:38.550 --> 12:39.850
Not!

12:40.350 --> 12:44.120
Your chanting is just noise to me!

12:53.600 --> 12:55.760
Please save us, Merciful Goddess!

12:56.140 --> 12:57.160
Anyone!

12:57.840 --> 13:00.240
And? What did you want to talk about?

13:00.240 --> 13:02.800
The truth is, Master Sanzo,

13:03.180 --> 13:07.580
we wish to ask you to prolong
your stay here at our temple.

13:07.580 --> 13:10.140
My journey is urgent.

13:10.890 --> 13:14.590
One month! No, even for
just one week!

13:14.590 --> 13:19.860
Master Sanzo, your visit to our temple
was the Lord Buddha's will.

13:19.860 --> 13:21.560
There is surely no mistaking that!

13:22.160 --> 13:24.600
We would all very much like you

13:24.600 --> 13:26.970
to favor us with your preaching.

13:28.440 --> 13:33.810
I bet you people asked Koumyou
Sanzo the same thing, didn't you?

13:33.810 --> 13:38.300
Yes, we did, though he very
respectfully declined.

13:38.910 --> 13:42.080
That master of mine sure was
a lenient man.

13:42.720 --> 13:44.180
Master Sanzo?!

13:44.990 --> 13:46.790
You want me to tell you

13:46.790 --> 13:50.190
what Priest Koumyou Sanzo
wouldn't say to you?

13:52.590 --> 13:56.560
Quit acting like spoiled brats,
you old farts!

13:56.560 --> 13:58.430
How dare you?!

13:58.430 --> 14:01.030
You go too far, Master Sanzo!

14:01.940 --> 14:04.970
It is terrible! A demon has
entered our temple!

14:04.970 --> 14:07.170
It's yelling for Sanzo and his party,

14:07.810 --> 14:11.010
all the while killing those within
the temple one after another!

14:12.050 --> 14:13.240
What?!

14:17.250 --> 14:20.390
Hey, come on out, Priest Sanzo!

14:20.390 --> 14:23.290
If you don't hurry up, I'm gonna finish
eating all the monks here!

14:28.830 --> 14:33.770
Hey, brat, you're next. Got a
posthumous Buddhist name yet?

14:35.840 --> 14:37.170
Man, this is boring.

14:37.540 --> 14:39.630
We only get one filthy
bastard this time?

14:42.080 --> 14:45.640
I was looking forward to some
more beauties like last time.

14:46.880 --> 14:50.620
Are you guys the demon trio
that betrayed us?

14:50.620 --> 14:53.090
You've got some guts to come
out here instead of running.

14:53.620 --> 14:56.560
Hey! Come at me all together!

14:56.990 --> 15:00.480
Though you probably don't stand
a chance against me!

15:02.000 --> 15:04.100
Hey, what do you think?

15:04.100 --> 15:07.700
That big attitude of his pisses me off,
minus twenty points.

15:07.700 --> 15:11.040
He has a vulgar laugh,
minus fifteen points.

15:12.810 --> 15:15.640
Are you guys making fun of me?!

15:15.640 --> 15:18.950
Hey, he doesn't brush his teeth,
minus five points!

15:18.950 --> 15:20.570
Shut the hell up!

15:23.220 --> 15:25.210
Though he gets full marks
for having guts.

15:33.860 --> 15:37.490
I couldn't see them at all!
These bastards are fast!

15:42.840 --> 15:44.970
They're no ordinary demons!

15:44.970 --> 15:47.170
What the heck? He's totally puny!

15:47.170 --> 15:52.170
Don't tell me this is all you have
to back up your big talk.

15:53.080 --> 15:54.840
Of course not!

16:03.490 --> 16:05.480
A defensive wall?!

16:08.960 --> 16:10.260
I came up with the idea

16:10.260 --> 16:12.820
when we fought that spider woman
the other day.

16:13.900 --> 16:17.130
I thought maybe I could make a
barrier by materializing my chi.

16:17.670 --> 16:21.110
He instantly turned that huge
amount of chi into a barrier!

16:22.140 --> 16:25.510
That was cool, Hakkai!
I wanna try it too!

16:25.510 --> 16:28.810
Well, without the ability to
concentrate, it's a little...

16:29.120 --> 16:31.990
And they've still got the demon
power limiters on

16:31.990 --> 16:35.080
to maintain their human forms!

16:35.790 --> 16:39.160
What the hell would happen if
they took those limiters off?!

16:39.930 --> 16:42.900
In that case, the first strike wins!

16:42.900 --> 16:45.020
I'll show you my true powers!

16:50.240 --> 16:53.370
Oh, that's why his shirt is
missing the right sleeve.

16:53.770 --> 16:56.510
I was thinking it looked pretty dorky.

16:56.510 --> 17:00.450
Shut up! No one gets away with
making fun of my sense of fashion!

17:00.450 --> 17:01.940
Nyoi-bou!

17:08.090 --> 17:10.320
Wow! Talk about brute force!

17:10.320 --> 17:12.590
That's something, coming from you.

17:13.830 --> 17:15.990
I'll take care of you all
in one fell swoop!

17:17.160 --> 17:18.190
What?!

17:23.440 --> 17:26.300
What an ungainly way to fall,
minus forty points.

17:26.840 --> 17:28.110
Sanzo!

17:28.110 --> 17:30.480
That makes a total of minus
eighty points.

17:31.780 --> 17:35.880
Why's it that you always monopolize
the good scenes?

17:35.880 --> 17:39.190
I could've easily taken care
of this guy by myself.

17:39.190 --> 17:40.550
So it seems.

17:41.720 --> 17:44.160
If he's sending assassins
of your caliber after us,

17:44.160 --> 17:49.820
this Kougaiji lord of yours really
must not think much of us.

17:50.700 --> 17:54.000
What is the purpose of the experiments
to revive Gyumaoh?

17:54.000 --> 17:55.900
What's behind all this?

17:56.670 --> 17:58.870
You stink of blood.

17:58.870 --> 18:01.840
How many people's blood have
you been splattered with?

18:01.840 --> 18:04.410
The title of Sanzo would be
appalled to hear of it.

18:04.410 --> 18:07.640
Minus twenty points. That's game over.

18:08.120 --> 18:11.980
Idiot, the one whose game
is over is you!

18:12.650 --> 18:14.590
Die!

18:17.990 --> 18:19.790
Makai Tenjou!

18:28.840 --> 18:31.030
You only get one continue.

18:37.880 --> 18:41.340
So there you are! Are you hurt?

18:42.350 --> 18:45.080
What in the world are you people?!

18:49.420 --> 18:52.060
It said you've been splattered
by the blood of many!

18:52.060 --> 18:54.390
Have you killed in this manner
time and again?!

18:56.000 --> 18:58.230
Hey, it's not like we have a choice!

18:58.230 --> 19:00.870
If we don't kill them, they'll kill us!

19:00.870 --> 19:05.010
We do not think that it
is a good thing, but...

19:05.010 --> 19:07.110
Of course it's not good!

19:07.110 --> 19:09.880
The act of taking lives,
no matter whose it is,

19:09.880 --> 19:12.250
is blasphemy against the Lord Buddha!

19:12.250 --> 19:14.980
Do you really mean what
you're saying?

19:15.980 --> 19:20.040
You still mean it after seeing so many
of your fellow monks killed?

19:21.990 --> 19:25.250
If you want to be so close
to the gods, just die!

19:26.990 --> 19:30.700
Anyone can become closer
to Buddha if they die.

19:30.700 --> 19:32.430
Like those monks there.

19:36.500 --> 19:37.830
No...

19:38.410 --> 19:40.930
But too bad for us.

19:45.380 --> 19:48.750
It just so happens that we're alive.

20:07.870 --> 20:08.900
Yo...

20:08.900 --> 20:11.810
Master Sanzo, when
everything is over,

20:11.810 --> 20:14.070
won't you come visit
our temple again?

20:14.640 --> 20:16.110
When you do...

20:16.710 --> 20:20.170
When you do, please
teach me mah-jongg!

20:21.250 --> 20:22.680
I'll remember to do that.

20:29.320 --> 20:32.720
Master Sanzo, thank you very much.

20:43.170 --> 20:49.200
That's right, even sudden
tragedies come

20:49.580 --> 20:54.710
Looking good-natured, without
cause for suspicion

20:55.150 --> 21:00.420
Don't complain, just shut up

21:00.420 --> 21:03.720
And look up

21:03.720 --> 21:09.730
I'll stay in character no matter
how ordinary the scene is

21:09.730 --> 21:15.070
Before any talk of dreams or hopes

21:15.070 --> 21:20.510
It's probably the same for everyone

21:20.510 --> 21:24.470
You must fight against yourself

21:31.390 --> 21:35.020
The sun sets and a new day comes

21:35.020 --> 21:37.220
Repeating is one change

21:37.220 --> 21:41.300
Don't avert eyes from differences

21:41.300 --> 21:45.200
Your nerve and soul to the limit

21:45.200 --> 21:48.040
Go forward now

21:48.040 --> 21:53.010
Standing next to the taut pressure

21:53.010 --> 21:58.450
I'll laugh more boldly and
fearlessly than anyone

21:58.450 --> 22:03.950
It's probably the same for everyone

22:03.950 --> 22:07.980
You must fight against yourself

22:17.800 --> 22:19.270
Next Saiyuki

22:20.500 --> 22:22.940
Hey, Gojyo, who's Jien?

22:22.940 --> 22:24.810
Both you and that girl that
likes to do laundry

22:24.810 --> 22:27.670
suddenly started acting different
when you heard that name.

22:27.670 --> 22:30.440
I really hate things like that.

22:30.440 --> 22:34.180
I don't have any secrets or anything,
so why do you guys?

22:34.180 --> 22:37.670
Come on, how is he related
to you guys?

22:38.250 --> 22:38.420
Next Time
Crimson Tears

22:38.420 --> 22:42.520
Next Time
Crimson Tears
Next Gensou Maden Saiyuki:
"Crimson Tears"

22:42.520 --> 22:42.920
Next Gensou Maden Saiyuki:
"Crimson Tears"

22:42.920 --> 22:44.390
You'd do well to watch!
